            "review_text": "TravelWanderlust90\nLondon, United Kingdom124 contributions\n0\nGood but need to improve\nNov 2017 • Friends\nStaffs are very friendly and helpful. Restaurant is on main road (big) with 3-4 floors. The Soup is nicely cooked and tasty, prawns, quail egg, noodle, ghe (king crab?!), dried fish cake ... all good except for the chilli garlic sauce, I found out the garlic maybe mould as it turned to another color plus some flies came from outside, jumped into chilli sauce. \n\nI still recommend to try this Banh Canh Ghe because it is delicious, special to try out apart from Pho, Bun Bo Hue. However watchout at your soup, sauces before eating. The staffs were willing to change my soup when I complained about flies inside my bowl.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 17, 2017",
