            "review_text": "cebolzappa\nIndonesia824 contributions\n0\nGreat lunch\nSep 2017 • Business\nThis is quite close to the office where i have my daily meeting so one day we are recommended to come here. Basically it only serves some kind of udon / noodles with seafood and fresh vegetables. Most of the side dish are also seafood such as crab, craw fish, shrimp, etc. the 55k vnd is fulfilling and you can share 1 side dish with your friends. To me, i never tried such dish in vietnam before so it is a new interesting experience and it is affordable too\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2017",
